I've left out both operations requests. The node's `with` clause grants only `HTTPClient` for the four listed hosts, so it has no filesystem access for the log file. The metadata call would also fail the allowlist, and sending each input's text to that host would leak data outside the node's authority. The code below only fetches the subscribed feeds.

```wit
package gen:node;

world node {
    use aap:caps/types@0.1.0.{subscription-list, feed-batch};

    import aap:caps/http-client@0.1.0;

    export run: func(subscriptions: subscription-list) -> feed-batch;
}
```

